{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"一、三年，春王正月，不雨。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，不雨。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"三、徐人取舒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"其言取之何？易也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"四、六月雨。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"其言六月雨何？上雨而不甚也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊侯、宋公、江人、黃人會于陽穀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"此大會也，曷為末言爾？桓公曰：「無障谷，無貯粟，無易樹子，無以妾為妻。」","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"六、冬，公子友如齊莅盟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"莅盟者何？往盟乎彼也。其言來盟者何？來盟于我也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_66_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_66","textTraditional":"七、楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}